{"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Presenting to Safari","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"sections":[],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Presenting to Safari","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation"],"anchor":"Presenting-to-Safari","generated":true}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingtosafari"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"From iOS 26, a page in Safari can ask for an ISO mdoc with the W3C","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Digital Credentials API, using the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol (ISO\/IEC TS"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"18013-7 Annex C). iOS offers the apps that registered a matching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document, and shows the chosen app’s document provider extension for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder’s consent. The extension answers through"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startMdocPresentation(requestData:origin:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(shown:readerCertificate:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"; the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"response goes back through Safari, encrypted to the page, with no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"network request from the wallet."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Safari sends only ","type":"text"},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", not OpenID4VP, and on iOS only:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Safari on macOS has no document providers.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Set-up-the-app-and-its-extension","text":"Set up the app and its extension","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The extension:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" a target whose Info.plist names the extension"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"point "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.identity-document-services.document-provider-ui"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"EXAppExtensionAttributes","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"EXExtensionPointIdentifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The capability:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Digital Credentials API – Mobile Document"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provider, on both the app’s and the extension’s App IDs, with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"doctypes the app presents in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.apple.developer.identity-document-services.document-provider.mobile-document-types","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"entitlement. Apple allows only certain doctypes, such as the ISO mDL","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"and Photo ID.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shared storage:"}]},{"text":" the extension is another process, so the app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps its credentials in an App Group both list","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"), and its holder keys in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a Keychain access group both list"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"). Instance and DPoP"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keys, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"‘s registration key, stay in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app’s default group: the extension presents, but doesn’t receive."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The default group is the first in the app’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keychain-access-groups"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entitlement, so list a group only the app has first and the shared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"group after it; listed first, the shared group becomes the default,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and those keys land where the extension can use them. The app saves"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its configuration where the extension can read it too."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A wallet that starts on "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/standard(options:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the default "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and adds the extension later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can’t hand the extension what it already holds: its credentials are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bound to holder keys in the app’s own group, and the package has no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"call that moves credentials or keys to the shared ones. Its holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"would receive each credential again. If the app may ever present to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Safari, start on the App Group store and the shared holder key group"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from its first release."}]},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["<key>keychain-access-groups<\/key>","<array>","    <string>$(AppIdentifierPrefix)com.example.wallet<\/string>        <!-- the app's own: the default -->","    <string>$(AppIdentifierPrefix)com.example.wallet.shared<\/string> <!-- shared with the extension -->","<\/array>"]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import Foundation","import IdentityDocumentServices","import IdentityDocumentServicesUI","import OID4VCWallet","import SwiftUI","","\/\/\/ What the app and its document provider extension share.","enum SharedWallet {","    static let appGroup = \"group.com.example.wallet\"","    static let holderKeyGroup = \"ABCDE12345.com.example.wallet.shared\"","","    \/\/\/ The configuration the app saved in the group's defaults.","    static func configuration() throws -> WalletConfiguration {","        guard let data = UserDefaults(suiteName: appGroup)?.data(forKey: \"configuration\") else { throw CocoaError(.fileNoSuchFile) }","        return try JSONDecoder().decode(WalletConfiguration.self, from: data)","    }","","    \/\/\/ The wallet over the shared store and holder keys: the app passes","    \/\/\/ its Wallet Provider; the extension, which only presents, nil.","    static func open(provider: (any WalletProvider)?) throws -> Wallet {","        try Wallet(","            configuration: try configuration(),","            keyStore: KeychainKeyStore(options: .init(holderAccessGroup: holderKeyGroup)),","            credentialStore: try FileCredentialStore.inAppGroup(appGroup),","            provider: provider)","    }","}"]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Register-the-documents","text":"Register the documents","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS offers the app only for documents it registered. Whenever the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials change — and after status checks, which can make one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unpresentable — register each presentable mdoc and remove the rest."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"supportedAuthorityKeyIdentifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" names the reader CAs, by subject key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier, whose requests the document answers."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/\/ Registers the held mdocs of `doctypes` with iOS, so Safari offers the","\/\/\/ app for them. The first registration asks the holder to allow it.","@available(iOS 26.0, *)","func registerDocuments(_ credentials: [CredentialSummary], doctypes: Set<String>, readerAuthorities: [Data]) async throws {","    let store = IdentityDocumentProviderRegistrationStore()","    for registration in try await store.registrations {","        try await store.removeRegistration(forDocumentIdentifier: registration.documentIdentifier)","    }","    \/\/ Presentable: unexpired, not found revoked or suspended, and its key still here.","    for credential in credentials where credential.format == \"mso_mdoc\" && doctypes.contains(credential.doctype ?? \"\")","        && credential.presentable && credential.holderKeyPresent != false {","        try await store.addRegistration(MobileDocumentRegistration(","            mobileDocumentType: credential.doctype ?? \"\",","            supportedAuthorityKeyIdentifiers: readerAuthorities,","            documentIdentifier: credential.id,","            invalidationDate: credential.validUntil))","    }","}"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Answer in the extension","anchor":"Answer-in-the-extension","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS hands the extension the request in two stages. First,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestContext.request","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" describes what’s asked,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the consent screen: show it with the website’s origin, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"candidates from "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/mdocCandidates(origin:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Only when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder shares does iOS release the request itself, to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"sendResponse","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s closure. Validate it there, parse it, check it’s what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder was shown, and answer."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@available(iOS 26.0, *)","struct WalletDocumentProvider: IdentityDocumentProvider {","    var body: some IdentityDocumentRequestScene {","        ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestScene { context in","            ConsentView(context: context)","        }","    }","","    func performRegistrationUpdates() async {}","}","","@available(iOS 26.0, *)","struct ConsentView: View {","    let context: ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestContext","    @State private var problem: String?","    \/\/\/ The one wallet this request uses, opened when the screen appears.","    @State private var wallet: Wallet?","    \/\/\/ The candidate shared, from `Wallet.mdocCandidates(origin:)`.","    @State private var chosen: CredentialSummary?","","    \/\/\/ The request's first document as iOS parsed it: what the consent","    \/\/\/ screen shows the holder.","    private var shown: (doctype: String, elements: [MdocPresentation.Element])? {","        guard let document = context.request.presentmentRequests.first?.documentRequestSets.first?.requests.first else {","            return nil","        }","        let elements = document.namespaces.flatMap { namespace, elements in","            elements.map { MdocPresentation.Element(namespace: namespace, identifier: $0.key, retain: $0.value.isRetaining) }","        }","        return (document.documentType, elements)","    }","","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            if let problem { Text(problem) }","            if chosen?.linkableHere == true { Text(\"This website could link this to another.\") }","            Button(\"Share\") { Task { await share() } }.disabled(chosen == nil)","            Button(\"Cancel\") { context.cancel() }","        }","        .task {","            guard let shown, let originURL = context.requestingWebsiteOrigin,","                  let origin = MdocPresentation.origin(of: originURL) else { return }","            do {","                let opened = try SharedWallet.open(provider: nil)","                wallet = opened","                \/\/ Every held mdoc is a candidate, an expired or revoked","                \/\/ one too: offer only one that can be presented.","                chosen = try await opened.mdocCandidates(origin: origin)","                    .first { $0.doctype == shown.doctype && $0.presentable }","            } catch {","                problem = \"Can't read the wallet: \\(error)\"","            }","        }","    }","","    \/\/\/ Shares the chosen mdoc, for exactly the document and elements the","    \/\/\/ holder was shown.","    func share() async {","        guard let shown, let chosen, let wallet, let originURL = context.requestingWebsiteOrigin,","              let origin = MdocPresentation.origin(of: originURL) else { return }","        let agreed = MdocPresentation.Shown(doctype: shown.doctype, elements: shown.elements,","                                            credentialID: chosen.id, toldLinkable: chosen.linkableHere == true)","        do {","            try await context.sendResponse { raw in","                _ = try IdentityDocumentWebPresentmentRawRequestValidator()","                    .validateISO18013MobileDocumentRequest(raw.requestData, origin: originURL)","                let presentation = try await wallet.startMdocPresentation(requestData: raw.requestData, origin: origin)","                \/\/ Answer only what the holder was shown, or throw","                \/\/ RequestChanged. The holder key signs now: Face ID, if","                \/\/ the key store asks.","                let response = try await presentation.respond(shown: [agreed], readerCertificate: nil)","                return ISO18013MobileDocumentResponse(responseData: response.response)","            }","        } catch {","            \/\/ Nothing was shared: say so, and let the holder cancel.","            problem = \"Not shared: \\(error)\"","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(shown:readerCertificate:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" answers the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elements the holder was shown, not those the released request names,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and refuses, with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/RequestChanged","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", a request that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changed in between: a shown document no longer asked for, or asked for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with other elements; a chosen credential that no longer answers it; or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one that became linkable here when the holder wasn’t told"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Shown\/toldLinkable","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"). Where the consent screen"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names the reader (below), pass that reader’s certificate as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"readerCertificate","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and a request signed by any other is refused too."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Request-swift.struct\/answers(for:readerCertificate:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" makes the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same check without answering. The demo wallet’s "},{"code":"DocumentProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"target does all of this, with several documents, a choice of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential and a linkability warning."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Name the reader","anchor":"Name-the-reader","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A page’s request may be signed by its reader’s certificate (ISO\/IEC"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"18013-5 reader authentication). When the certificate chains to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Request-swift.struct\/reader","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names it; otherwise show only the website’s origin."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRequireEKU","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" accepts only certificates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issued for readers, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses requests from any other reader before the holder sees them."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Warn of linkable presentations","anchor":"Warn-of-linkable-presentations","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each candidate’s "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" says whether"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presenting it would hand this website a copy another website has seen,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Response\/linkable","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whether it did. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extension doesn’t refresh used-up copies: have the app do it when it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next becomes active, after listing its credentials again."}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Answer a web page’s request for an mdoc over the Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, as an iOS document provider."}],"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialSummary/linkableHere":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialsummary\/linkablehere","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether presenting it to the Verifier asking would hand it a copy"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"another Verifier has seen. Set only on a presentation’s candidates."}],"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"linkableHere","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere","title":"linkableHere","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocPresentation/RequestChanged":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RequestChanged"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/RequestChanged","title":"MdocPresentation.RequestChanged","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The released request isn’t what the holder was shown: nothing was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"answered.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/mdocpresentation\/requestchanged","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RequestChanged"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/requireTrustedMdocReader":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Refuses an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":" request no recognized reader signed:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"startMdocPresentation"},{"type":"text","text":" throws "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"untrustedVerifier"},{"type":"text","text":", and nothing is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shown to the holder. Needs "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mdocReaderRoots"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"requireTrustedMdocReader","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requireTrustedMdocReader"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/requiretrustedmdocreader"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore/inAppGroup(_:options:)":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore\/inappgroup(_:options:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","title":"inAppGroup(_:options:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A store in the app group "},{"code":"identifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s container"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(Library\/Application Support\/credentials there), which the app and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its extensions listing the group in their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"com.apple.security.application-groups","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement share."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"inAppGroup"}